                    "type": "CallExpression",
                    "name": "setDesc",
                    "source": "When off (default), all interactive behaviour — hover selector strips, click-to-edit, double-click panels, choice dropdowns — is disabled in Obsidian's reading view. Live preview / source mode is always interactive.",
                    "target": "当关闭 (默认) 时，所有交互行为——悬停选择条、单击编辑、双击面板、选择下拉——在黑曜石的阅读视图中都会被禁用。实时预览/源代码模式始终是交互的。"
                },
                {
                    "type": "CallExpression",
                    "name": "setDesc",
                    "source": "When on, a single click on a cell enters edit mode immediately (no ~200ms delay), and the style panel opens with Ctrl/Cmd+click instead of double-click. Speeds up rapid consecutive editing. When off (default), single click enters edit after a short delay and double click opens the style panel.",
                    "target": "打开时，单击单元格会立即进入编辑模式 (没有约 200 毫秒的延迟)，并且样式面板会使用 Ctrl/Cmd+click 打开，而不是双击。加速快速连续编辑。关闭时 (默认值)，单击会在短延迟后进入编辑，并且双击会打开样式面板。"
                },
